          "title": "You'll want to know: चौड़ा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चौड़ा — cauṛā — \"wide\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चौड़ा (cauṛā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from ca-uḍa, \"wide, open\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 4534). CDIAL suggests, with a \"possibly\", that it was built on cau-, \"four\"."
            }
          ]
        },
